{{Protection}}{{MagicWords}}

{{Card Infobox|Cost=2|Rarity=Legendary|Type=Spell|Arena=Electro Valley|ReleaseDate=4 July 2016}}

{{Quote|A spilt bottle of Rage turned an innocent tree trunk into "The Log". Now, it seeks revenge by crushing anything in its path! Reduced damage to Crown Towers.}}

The “The Log” is a {{Rarity|Legendary}} [[Cards|card]] that is unlocked from the [[Arenas|Electro Valley (Arena 11)]]. It is an area-damage, ground-targeting [[:Category:Spell Cards|spell]] with a very long rectangular area and moderate damage that also inflicts knockback to any [[:Category:Troop Cards|troop]] it hits. It can only be deployed on the player's own side. It appears as a long, spiked piece of wood. A "The Log" card costs 2 [[Elixir]] to deploy.

