== History==
2016
*The Log [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 4/7/2016, in the [[Version History#Tournaments Update (4/7/2016)|Tournaments Update]].
*On 24/8/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (24/8/2016)|Balance Update]], increased The Log's casting speed to 300 (from 180) and its projectile speed to 170 (from 140).
*On 19/9/2016, the [[Version History#September 2016 Update (19/9/2016)|September 2016 Update]], allowed The Log to push back all ground [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]]. This allowed The Log to reset the charge attacks of the [[Prince]] and [[Dark Prince]].
*On 20/10/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (20/10/2016)|Balance Update]], increased The Log's casting speed to 360 (from 300), its projectile speed to 200 (from 170), its rolling distance to 11.6 tiles (from 9.6 tiles), and its damage by 8.5%.
2017
*On 23/1/2017 a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/1/2017)|Balance Update]], decreased The Log's damage by 4% and decreased its pushback range to 1 tile (from 1.5 tiles).
*On 13/3/2017, the [[Version History#March 2017 Update (13/3/2017)|March 2017 Update]], decreased The Log's damage by 4% and decrease its rolling distance to 11.1 tiles (from 11.6 tiles). On the same day, a bug was discovered where the Log was not able to be deployed on top of [[:Category:Building Cards|buildings]]. To compensate for this, in a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (13/3/2017)|maintenance break]], the rolling distance was restored to 11.6 tiles until the next client update.
*On 12/6/2017, the [[Version History#June 2017 Update (12/6/2017)|June 2017 Update]], decreased The Log's rolling distance to 11.1 tiles (from 11.6 tiles). The bug that prevented the Log from being deployed on top of buildings was also fixed.
*On 12/12/2017, the [[Version History#Electrifying Update (12/12/2017)|Electrifying Update]], decreased The Log’s [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Tower]] damage to 35% of the full damage (from 40%).
2018
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], allowed The Log to be placed on the river if a Crown Tower has been already destroyed.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Legendary}} cards start at Level 9 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 5).
*On 1/10/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (1/10/2018)|Balance Update]], fixed a bug where troops that were spawned after their parent troops died would be immune to [[:Category:Spell Cards|spell]] damage.
2020
*On 7/4/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/4/2020)|Balance Update]], added a card render to The Log's card info screen.
*On 4/8/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased The Log's rolling distance to 10.1 tile (from 11.1 tiles), and decreased its Crown Tower damage to 30% of the full damage (from 35%).
*On 4/12/2020, a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(4/12/2020)|maintenance break]], changed The Log's card render, by adding holiday lights on it.
2021
*On 11/2/2021, a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(11/2/2021)|maintenance break]], reverted The Log's card render to their state before 4/12/2020.
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], slightly changed The Log's description, adding the phrase “''Reduced damage to Crown Towers.''” to it.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 7/6/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/6/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased The Log's Crown Tower damage to 20% of the full damage (from 30%).
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock The Log from Builder's Workshop to Electro Valley.
2023
*On 7/2/2023, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/2/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased The Log's pushback range to 0.7 tiles (from 1 tile).
*On 27/3/2023, the [[Version History#Losers%20Update%20(27/3/2023)|Losers Update]], improved The Log's collision detection.
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 4/3/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/3/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased The Log's Crown Tower damage to 15% of the full damage (from 20%).
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased The Log's damage by 0.34%.
*On 8/7/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/7/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased The Log's damage by 8%.
*On 1/9/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (1/9/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Log's damage by 1%.
2026

* On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update, decreased The Log's Crown Tower damage to 13% of the full damage (from 15%)

